1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,768
(Sheldon:)Wrong. And let's keep it clean, shall we?

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:07,150
Kangaroo. Uh, l'd be a kangajew...

3
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:11,780
(Howard:)...the first of my people
to dunk a basketball.

4
00:00:12,281 --> 00:00:16,911
Also, instead ofjust living in your mother's
house, you could live inside her body.

5
00:00:20,498 --> 00:00:22,288
(Sheldon:)Clever, but also wrong.

6
00:00:22,541 --> 00:00:26,541
(Sheldon:)No. The best organism for human beings
to merge with is the lichen itseIf.

7
00:00:26,754 --> 00:00:29,844
(Sheldon:)That way you'd be
human, fungus and algae.

8
00:00:30,049 --> 00:00:31,549
(Sheldon:)Triple threat.

9
00:00:31,717 --> 00:00:33,347
(Sheldon:)Like three-bean salad.

10
00:00:34,637 --> 00:00:36,927
(Leonard:)Give me one circumstance
that would be useful.

11
00:00:37,181 --> 00:00:40,141
(Sheldon:)All right, picture this.
A beautiful outdoor concert.

12
00:00:40,309 --> 00:00:42,939
(Sheldon:)Now, as a human,
l appreciate Beethoven.

13
00:00:43,104 --> 00:00:47,654
(Sheldon:)As a fungus, I have a terrific view
growing out of a towering maple tree.

14
00:00:47,858 --> 00:00:51,028
(Sheldon:)And no thank you expensive concessions
because as an algae...

15
00:00:51,195 --> 00:00:53,325
(Sheldon:)...I'll just snack on this sunlight.

16
00:00:54,406 --> 00:00:56,946
- He got us again.
- No, he didn't.

17
00:00:57,368 --> 00:01:03,018
(Raj:)Anyway, if it's okay with you,
we should talk about Howard's bachelor party.

